  m_text: 'This short exam will test your knowledge retention with the learning material
    provided. <color=lightblue>Make sure you use the learning material provided!
    You can open it through the Learning Material button below. </color>You will
    be questioned on your theory on polynomials and complex numbers. Make sure to
    have a pen, paper and calculator on the ready.<color=yellow> You are not allowed
    to use external resources others than what is provided within the project and
    the learning material.</color>


    This exam will last 30 minutes. You are
    free to submit your answers and results before that time however. Once the 30
    minutes has elapsed, your information will automatically be recorded, with the
    current answers on your exam.


    Best of luck, and take as much time as necessary
    to prepare!'
